{
  "name": "K2-AI · Outlook → email_messages (in)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "event": "messageReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "aaaaaaaa-1111-4111-8111-aaaaaaaaaaaa",
      "name": "Outlook · nuova mail",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.microsoftOutlookTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [380, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "microsoftOutlookOAuth2Api": { "id": "REPLACE_ME", "name": "Microsoft Outlook account" }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "create",
        "tableId": "email_messages",
        "dataToSend": "defineBelow",
        "fieldsUi": {
          "fieldValues": [
            { "fieldId": "conversation_id", "fieldValue": "={{ $json.conversationId }}" },
            { "fieldId": "message_id",      "fieldValue": "={{ $json.id }}" },
            { "fieldId": "direction",       "fieldValue": "in" },
            { "fieldId": "from_email",      "fieldValue": "={{ ($json.from && $json.from.emailAddress) ? $json.from.emailAddress.address : $json.from }}" },
            { "fieldId": "from_name",       "fieldValue": "={{ ($json.from && $json.from.emailAddress) ? $json.from.emailAddress.name : $json.from }}" },
            { "fieldId": "to_email",        "fieldValue": "={{ ($json.toRecipients && $json.toRecipients[0]) ? $json.toRecipients[0].emailAddress.address : $json.to }}" },
            { "fieldId": "subject",         "fieldValue": "={{ $json.subject }}" },
            { "fieldId": "body",            "fieldValue": "={{ ($json.body && $json.body.content) ? $json.body.content : $json.bodyPreview }}" },
            { "fieldId": "body_preview",    "fieldValue": "={{ $json.bodyPreview }}" },
            { "fieldId": "status",          "fieldValue": "ricevuto" },
            { "fieldId": "received_at",     "fieldValue": "={{ $json.receivedDateTime || $now }}" },
            { "fieldId": "is_read",         "fieldValue": "={{ $json.isRead }}" }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "bbbbbbbb-2222-4222-8222-bbbbbbbbbbbb",
      "name": "Supabase · email_messages",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [640, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": { "id": "REPLACE_ME", "name": "Supabase K2-AI" }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Outlook · nuova mail": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Supabase · email_messages", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": { "executionOrder": "v1" },
  "pinData": {},
  "meta": {
    "note": "INBOUND. Outlook (OAuth, ok con MFA) -> riga in public.email_messages con direction='in' e conversation_id (per raggruppare i thread). L'AIOS legge questa tabella come leggi_inbox e l'agente prepara la bozza di risposta nel cockpit (Conversazioni). Dopo import: aggancia le 2 credenziali (Microsoft Outlook OAuth2 + Supabase host https://uiuvwzrmrdqbfajguuab.supabase.co + Service Role secret), poi ATTIVA. message_id e UNIQUE -> eventuali errori 'duplicate' sono innocui (mail gia presa). L'invio della risposta e nell'altro workflow (k2ai, ramo send_email)."
  }
}
